<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>.32 Revolver</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="STYL.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>The .32 Revolver</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#history">History</a></li>
                <li><a href="#specs">Specifications</a></li>
                <li><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="hero">
        <h2>Classic Firearm</h2>
        <p>Explore the legacy of the .32 revolver, a timeless piece of craftsmanship.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="history">
        <h2>History</h2>
        <p>The .32 revolver has a rich history dating back to the late 19th century. It was popular among law enforcement and civilians alike for its compact size and reliability.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="specs">
        <h2>Specifications</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Caliber: .32 S&W</li>
            <li>Barrel Length: 3 inches</li>
            <li>Weight: 1.5 lbs</li>
            <li>Capacity: 6 rounds</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery">
        <h2>Gallery</h2>
        <img src="revolver.jpg" alt=".32 Revolver" class="gallery-image">
        <p>Image of a classic .32 revolver.</p>
    </section>

    <footer id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For inquiries, please email us at: <a href="mailto:info@32revolver.com">info@32revolver.com</a></p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>